# OctoAcme Project Management Docs

This repository centralizes the project management processes used by OctoAcme. It provides a practical, shared model for how teams initiate, plan, execute, release, and improve work.

## Project management process summary

OctoAcme uses a lightweight lifecycle that moves from problem validation and initiation through planning, execution, release, and continuous improvement. The process emphasizes clear ownership, stakeholder alignment, measurable outcomes, risk management, and regular communication across delivery teams.

